{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Forsaken Lands, you will descend into a world of mystery and myth. Explore the ruins of an ancient civilization hidden in shadowy forests, hunt down the Great Necromancer, and uncover his dark secrets. Beyond it all awaits an epic confrontation with the gods themselves!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/e57b3aedb7d0131f7ecbf7eb1ddcf7ae.poster.avif?t=1763759094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/e57b3aedb7d0131f7ecbf7eb1ddcf7ae.webm?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/e57b3aedb7d0131f7ecbf7eb1ddcf7ae.mp4?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/ee820bfdef01474e8b052193e6ca8d56.avif?t=1763759094\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a squad of three unique heroes, each with their own deck of cards, special abilities, and playstyle. Combine their strengths and cover their weaknesses to assemble the ultimate team. As you progress, your heroes grow stronger by unlocking new cards, skills, and customization options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/322ca805265e2552cc24dccecafbeec1.poster.avif?t=1763759094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/322ca805265e2552cc24dccecafbeec1.webm?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/322ca805265e2552cc24dccecafbeec1.mp4?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/f43049e6f67c9d8b4684b3d4573695d9.avif?t=1763759094\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to unwind and delve into lore? Then Story Mode is for you:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique narrative campaign for each trio of heroes</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich hero backstories, relationships, and intertwined destinies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Familiar and brand-new locations, each teeming with distinct enemies and events.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/50db1f1e1bc8e1a09f82828a4e0cb55f.poster.avif?t=1763759094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/50db1f1e1bc8e1a09f82828a4e0cb55f.webm?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/50db1f1e1bc8e1a09f82828a4e0cb55f.mp4?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/4ec5a8862ddf07ddda4d88a7ea68c21a.avif?t=1763759094\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then jump into Dreams Mode:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A procedurally generated adventure that offers a fresh experience each time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle Modifiers that alter combat rules and objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random events and unpredictable foes to keep you on your toes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/4927c1ef26ed8b7df4db61d5e8a3c1ab.poster.avif?t=1763759094\" width=780 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/4927c1ef26ed8b7df4db61d5e8a3c1ab.webm?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/4927c1ef26ed8b7df4db61d5e8a3c1ab.mp4?t=1763759094\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/78e796871883610ca5fcf4b1c01cde3a.avif?t=1763759094\" width=780 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a heroic squad and take on Story Mode or dive into a random Dream run together.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op for up to 3 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each session lasts around 1\u20131.5 hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Heroes progress just like in solo mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ping system to coordinate your tactics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2464640/extras/827a443ae553a71c99b271ee594fab15.poster.avif?t=1763759094\" width=1170 height=658 ><source sr